      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me understand this bit in an NDA i'm looking at? it's for a fintech gig. \n\n\"Notwithstanding the foregoing, nothing in this Agreement shall restrict the Receiving Party from using the Residuals (defined as ideas, concepts, know-how, or techniques retained in the unaided memory of the Receiving Party's personnel) for any purpose, provided that the Receiving Party shall not disclose any Confidential Information in violation of this Agreement.\"\n\nbasically does this mean i can still use the coding patterns i learn there for my other clients later?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
